{
  "info": {
    "name": "Vinheria Agnello - IoT - device096",
    "description": "Cadastro, consultas NGSIv2 e historico STH-Comet do CP05. Consulte os recursos antes de executar POST; nao recrie cadastro nem assinatura existentes. Importar nao executa requisicoes.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "servidor",
      "value": "3.135.234.101",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 - Consultar grupo TEF",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "fiware-service",
            "value": "smart",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "fiware-servicepath",
            "value": "/",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": "http://{{servidor}}:4041/iot/services",
        "description": "Confira o grupo TEF no servico smart e caminho /. O servidor do professor fornece esse grupo compartilhado."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2 - Consultar cadastro device096",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "fiware-service",
            "value": "smart",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "fiware-servicepath",
            "value": "/",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": "http://{{servidor}}:4041/iot/devices/device096",
        "description": "HTTP 200: reutilize o cadastro. Apenas se retornar 404, execute a proxima requisicao."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3 - Cadastrar device096 - somente se ausente",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "fiware-service",
            "value": "smart",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "fiware-servicepath",
            "value": "/",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": "http://{{servidor}}:4041/iot/devices",
        "description": "Executar somente quando a consulta do device096 retornar 404. Resposta esperada: 201 Created. O grupo TEF compartilhado permanece intacto.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"devices\": [\n    {\n      \"device_id\": \"device096\",\n      \"entity_name\": \"urn:ngsi-ld:device:096\",\n      \"entity_type\": \"device\",\n      \"apikey\": \"TEF\",\n      \"protocol\": \"PDI-IoTA-UltraLight\",\n      \"transport\": \"MQTT\",\n      \"timestamp\": true,\n      \"attributes\": [\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"p\",\n          \"name\": \"p\",\n          \"type\": \"Number\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"t\",\n          \"name\": \"t\",\n          \"type\": \"Number\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"h\",\n          \"name\": \"h\",\n          \"type\": \"Number\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_id\": \"s\",\n          \"name\": \"s\",\n          \"type\": \"Text\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"commands\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"on\",\n          \"type\": \"command\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"off\",\n          \"type\": \"command\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4 - Consultar medicoes no Orion",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "fiware-service",
            "value": "smart",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "fiware-servicepath",
            "value": "/",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": "http://{{servidor}}:1026/v2/entities/urn:ngsi-ld:device:096?type=device",
        "description": "Depois de iniciar o Wokwi, confira p,t,h e os metadados TimeInstant de cada atributo. O timestamp global tambem pode mudar com o LED."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "5 - Conferir assinaturas",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "fiware-service",
            "value": "smart",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "fiware-servicepath",
            "value": "/",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": "http://{{servidor}}:1026/v2/subscriptions?limit=1000",
        "description": "Procure a entidade urn:ngsi-ld:device:096 nas assinaturas. Se ela ja estiver coberta por uma assinatura ativa para o STH e p,t,h, passe direto as consultas. Essa consulta tambem permite conferir timesSent, lastSuccessCode e lastFailureReason depois da ativacao."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "6 - Ativar historico - executar uma vez",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "fiware-service",
            "value": "smart",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "fiware-servicepath",
            "value": "/",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": "http://{{servidor}}:1026/v2/subscriptions",
        "description": "Execute uma unica vez, somente se nao existir assinatura ativa equivalente para esta entidade e p,t,h. Resposta esperada: 201 Created; guarde Headers > Location. O historico passa a guardar as medicoes recebidas apos sua ativacao.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"description\": \"CP05 - Historico p,t,h do device096\",\n  \"subject\": {\n    \"entities\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"urn:ngsi-ld:device:096\",\n        \"type\": \"device\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"condition\": {\n      \"attrs\": [\n        \"p\",\n        \"t\",\n        \"h\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"notification\": {\n    \"http\": {\n      \"url\": \"http://{{servidor}}:8666/notify\"\n    },\n    \"attrs\": [\n      \"p\",\n      \"t\",\n      \"h\"\n    ],\n    \"attrsFormat\": \"legacy\"\n  }\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "7 - Historico de temperatura",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "fiware-service",
            "value": "smart",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "fiware-servicepath",
            "value": "/",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": "http://{{servidor}}:8666/STH/v1/contextEntities/type/device/id/urn:ngsi-ld:device:096/attributes/t?lastN=10",
        "description": "Confira values com recvTime e attrValue. Valores constantes tambem geram amostras com novos timestamps. HTTP 200 com values vazio significa que nao ha amostras na resposta."
      },
      "response": []
    },
